1
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:46,544
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,544 --> 00:00:49,547
=Episode 14=

3
00:01:19,040 --> 00:01:20,640
What are you doing?

4
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:23,280
Your teacher told me
you're dropping out of school.

5
00:01:23,280 --> 00:01:24,720
What's the use of going to school?

6
00:01:24,720 --> 00:01:25,720
I don't want to study.

7
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,040
I want to be a star.

8
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,040
I want to make big money.

9
00:01:29,120 --> 00:01:30,520
Big money doesn't come that easily.

10
00:01:30,520 --> 00:01:31,880
You're so annoying.

11
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Xiaotang.

12
00:01:34,760 --> 00:01:35,760
Xiaotang.

13
00:01:36,560 --> 00:01:37,560
(This is the day.)

14
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:40,440
(The day I decided to drop out
and run away from home.)

15
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,520
(Not long after that,)

16
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:43,760
(Mom got sick.)

17
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:48,360
Xiaotang,

18
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:49,920
it's okay.

19
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,880
(Streamer Labor Contract)
Sign this contract.

20
00:01:51,880 --> 00:01:54,120
I'll handle your mom's medical bills.

21
00:01:55,906 --> 00:01:57,683
(Streamer Labor Contract)

22
00:02:05,160 --> 00:02:06,160
Xiaotang.

23
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,640
What's wrong with you?

24
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:15,520
Mom, I'm sorry.

25
00:02:16,040 --> 00:02:17,520
I'll never argue with you again.

26
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,880
This time, I will definitely study hard.

27
00:02:20,360 --> 00:02:21,360
I'll listen to you.

28
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,400
I'll do whatever you say.

29
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:29,640
Do you realize you're wrong?

30
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,080
And now you'll listen to me?

31
00:02:32,880 --> 00:02:35,480
Do you remember
the oath you swore last night?

32
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:39,120
You said you wouldn't go to school
even if you were beaten to death.

33
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,440
You told me

34
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,640
that if I kept pushing you,

35
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:44,680
you would run away from home.

36
00:02:45,720 --> 00:02:48,200
I can't sleep a wink last night.

37
00:02:48,800 --> 00:02:50,920
What tricks are you pulling now?

38
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:52,720
What do you want now?

39
00:02:52,720 --> 00:02:55,560
Mom, I mean it.

40
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:58,680
I was so foolish before.

41
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:00,880
I know you mean well for me.

42
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,400
This time, I will study hard.

43
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,600
Just trust me once.

44
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,120
Trust me one more time.

45
00:03:06,600 --> 00:03:07,600
Xiaotang,

46
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:10,640
do you really think that way?

47
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:12,920
Yes, Mom.

48
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,920
I promise

49
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:16,440
I will definitely study hard this time,

50
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,760
get into a good college,

51
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,240
and find a proper job.

52
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:22,680
I'll never chase
those star dreams anymore.

53
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,080
I swear.

54
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:29,120
Silly child.

55
00:03:29,320 --> 00:03:30,320
Alright.

56
00:03:30,320 --> 00:03:32,960
Look at you crying like this.
What a sight.

57
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:37,000
I'll freshen you up.
Time to go to school.

58
00:03:38,040 --> 00:03:39,040
Let's go.

59
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,800
Go to school.

60
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:43,520
Wait.

61
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,720
Changed your mind again?

62
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,480
Want to go to school and waste my money?

63
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:53,520
Don't talk nonsense.

64
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:55,200
My daughter has grown up.

65
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:56,680
She wants to study.

66
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,280
Grown up?

67
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:01,560
I think she just realized
she can't make it out there.

68
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:03,080
Study?

69
00:04:03,080 --> 00:04:04,080
My foot!

70
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,880
What's the use
of a girl studying so much?

71
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:11,080
It's better to start working
and earn money early.

72
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:12,800
I don't have money for her to waste.

73
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:15,200
Su Dawei, I don't care
if you agree or not.

74
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,320
I'll go out and dig through trash myself

75
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,960
to put my daughter through school.

76
00:04:22,880 --> 00:04:25,440
You wench, how dare you talk back to me?

77
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,080
Seeking a beating?

78
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,520
- Mom!
- I'll beat you to death today!

79
00:04:31,840 --> 00:04:33,640
How dare you defy me!

80
00:04:33,640 --> 00:04:34,640
Su Dawei!

81
00:04:38,200 --> 00:04:39,880
If you dare lay another finger
on my mom,

82
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:42,120
I won't let you leave here alive.

83
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:44,600
You brat, how dare you
point a knife at your father?

84
00:04:45,800 --> 00:04:46,800
Father?

85
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,280
A scum like you
doesn't deserve to be my father.

86
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,160
If I remember correctly,

87
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:54,480
you lost all your wages

88
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:56,200
at the Card Room in South City,

89
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,840
and borrowed 3,000 yuan
from the loan shark.

90
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,160
Nonsense!

91
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,200
Nonsense?

92
00:05:03,080 --> 00:05:04,120
After you got into debt,

93
00:05:04,520 --> 00:05:05,840
you ran off and disappeared.

94
00:05:05,840 --> 00:05:08,160
I worked to earn money
to help Mom pay for her treatment.

95
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,560
Your creditors caught me

96
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:10,680
and asked me where you were.

97
00:05:11,200 --> 00:05:12,240
I couldn't answer them,

98
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:15,480
so they beat me and cursed at me.

99
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:17,840
The loan shark's rules.

100
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:19,640
If you don't pay up in three days,

101
00:05:20,080 --> 00:05:22,360
you'd lose a finger.

102
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:24,240
Today...

103
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,640
Today is the third day, isn't it?

104
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:31,000
Su Dawei,

105
00:05:31,200 --> 00:05:33,800
the creditors aren't as merciful as me.

106
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,120
Mom.

107
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:50,320
Don't be afraid. It's okay now.

108
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:52,480
Heaven has given me this chance
to be back

109
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,480
and protect you.

110
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:56,280
This time, we will definitely
have a perfect ending.

111
00:05:57,240 --> 00:05:58,240
I promise.

112
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:13,120
(Since the loop has returned
to seven years ago,)

113
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:17,680
(this time, I have a chance
to change everything.)

114
00:06:19,080 --> 00:06:20,480
(Su Dawei, that animal!)

115
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:22,120
(This time,)

116
00:06:22,480 --> 00:06:24,400
(I will never let him hurt my mom.)

117
00:06:30,720 --> 00:06:31,720
(Ye Shen,)

118
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:34,000
(this time,)

119
00:06:34,880 --> 00:06:36,080
(will you be by my side?)

120
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,640
(Where are you right now?)

121
00:06:43,520 --> 00:06:44,640
Gu Xiaotang,

122
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:46,600
are you home?

123
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,800
The homeroom teacher sent me.

124
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,160
- (This voice...)
- She said you aren't coming to school.

125
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,320
She's worried about you.

126
00:06:56,054 --> 00:06:58,440
(Fashion)

127
00:06:58,440 --> 00:06:59,440
Gu Xiaotang,

128
00:07:00,480 --> 00:07:01,520
are you home?

129
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,800
The homeroom teacher sent me.

130
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:06,440
She said you aren't
coming to school anymore.

131
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:08,080
She's worried about you.

132
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,040
Ye Shen!

133
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,480
Wait a moment.

134
00:07:30,480 --> 00:07:31,480
I'll be right down.

135
00:07:45,320 --> 00:07:46,320
Ye Shen!

136
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:54,440
(Ye Shen,
fate has given us another chance.)

137
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:57,960
(This time, I will definitely help you
make up for your regrets.)

138
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:14,520
(I believe we will definitely
create a perfect ending.)

139
00:08:27,240 --> 00:08:29,720
Gu Xiaotang, what's wrong with you?

140
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,360
Long time no see.

141
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,360
Give me a hug.

142
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:36,480
The teacher asked me
to tell you to go back to class.

143
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:38,240
What's wrong with a hug?

144
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,360
Just grant me.

145
00:08:39,880 --> 00:08:41,200
This is a hug for our friendship.

146
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,200
Wait.

147
00:08:42,320 --> 00:08:44,000
We did cleaning together yesterday.

148
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,280
I wiped the blackboard for you.

149
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,520
How is it a long time?

150
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,400
Are you running a fever?

151
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,600
You...

152
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,960
Every loop is like this.

153
00:08:53,960 --> 00:08:55,440
Your memory keeps resetting.

154
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,440
My kindness goes in vain!

155
00:08:56,960 --> 00:09:00,000
Have you read too much sci-fi?

156
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:02,360
Hey you! Stop it!

157
00:09:03,920 --> 00:09:05,080
Stop right there!

158
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,840
Everyone, you'll have the exam.

159
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:10,000
Take out your books and review.

160
00:09:12,200 --> 00:09:13,520
Ye Shen, let me tell you...

161
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:16,320
Gu Xiaotang.

162
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:20,680
Miss, I've brought Gu Xiaotang back.

163
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,640
(This is real.)

164
00:09:33,040 --> 00:09:34,040
(Right.)

165
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,840
(This time, I have to seize the chance)

166
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:38,240
(to make up for the regrets
from Ye Shen and me.)

167
00:09:40,160 --> 00:09:42,240
I, Gu Xiaotang,

168
00:09:42,880 --> 00:09:44,400
have officially come back.

169
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:50,120
The old Gu Xiaotang died yesterday.

170
00:09:50,440 --> 00:09:53,240
Today, you will see
a brand-new Gu Xiaotang.

171
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:55,600
You will witness with your own eyes

172
00:09:55,600 --> 00:09:58,680
what rebirth from the ashes

173
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,280
means.

174
00:10:07,840 --> 00:10:10,000
Gu Xiaotang, go back to your seat.

175
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,480
The exam is coming.

176
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:13,360
Hope you can get great scores
like you say.

177
00:10:15,920 --> 00:10:16,920
Okay.

178
00:10:18,592 --> 00:10:20,352
(Go all out,
the promising future is coming)

179
00:10:20,352 --> 00:10:21,360
(128 days left
until college entrance exam)

180
00:10:21,360 --> 00:10:23,080
Alright, do your own exam paper.

181
00:10:23,320 --> 00:10:24,320
Behave.

182
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,440
(Is there anything more terrifying)

183
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:32,160
(than doing a math exam
right after coming back?)

184
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,520
(My regret)

185
00:10:36,520 --> 00:10:37,720
was in my high school days.

186
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:41,120
There were some things
that I didn't get to say

187
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:42,440
or get to do in time.

188
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,400
Thinking back now,

189
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,720
it's all too late.

190
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:49,800
(What exactly is Ye Shen's regret?)

191
00:10:50,320 --> 00:10:52,040
(Why wouldn't he tell me?)

192
00:10:53,640 --> 00:10:54,880
(Could it be...)

193
00:10:57,840 --> 00:10:59,680
(Could his regret be...)

194
00:11:34,717 --> 00:11:38,073
♪The face deep in the heart♪

195
00:11:38,265 --> 00:11:40,727
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

196
00:11:42,102 --> 00:11:45,802
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

197
00:11:46,013 --> 00:11:48,453
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

198
00:11:48,600 --> 00:11:50,972
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

199
00:11:51,122 --> 00:11:53,879
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

200
00:11:53,879 --> 00:11:56,200
♪Even for just a second♪

201
00:11:57,545 --> 00:12:01,008
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

202
00:12:01,136 --> 00:12:02,985
♪And sunlight reverses♪

203
00:12:02,985 --> 00:12:06,455
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

204
00:12:06,811 --> 00:12:08,885
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

205
00:12:09,387 --> 00:12:12,796
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

206
00:12:13,053 --> 00:12:18,265
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

207
00:12:19,519 --> 00:12:22,084
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

208
00:12:22,126 --> 00:12:25,579
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

209
00:12:26,156 --> 00:12:29,119
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

210
00:12:29,864 --> 00:12:32,472
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

211
00:12:32,472 --> 00:12:36,095
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

212
00:12:36,565 --> 00:12:40,621
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
